id: GQL-003
ilities: [authenticity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: GraphQL introspection enabled in production
category: graphql
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .rb .go .java
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: introspection
patterns:
  - regex: introspection\s*:\s*true
    message: "GraphQL introspection enabled — disable in production"
fix: Set introspection: process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production'. Introspection exposes your entire schema to attackers.
